## 4. Deterministic Metrics — Citation Page Evaluation
   - Extract generated cited_pages vs gold evidence page numbers
   - Normalize page numbers (handle format variations)
   - Compute citation precision, recall, F1 per sample and aggregate
   - Display results with bootstrap CIs

## 5. LLM Judge — Multi-Dimensional Rubric Evaluation
   - Initialize RQ3 judge
   - Run judge on ALL 204 samples (or resume from cache)
   - Display progress (API calls vs cached)
   - Aggregate per-dimension scores with bootstrap CIs
   - Display dimension-level results table
   - Plot radar chart or bar chart of dimension means

## 6. Combined Results Summary
   - Overview table: all deterministic + judge metrics
   - Primary metrics: Macro-F1, mean judge scores, citation F1
   - Per-ESRS-standard breakdown table (compliance accuracy + mean judge score)

## 7. Manual Audit Subset Selection
   - Stratified sampling: 30 samples covering all 12 ESRS standards
   - Include Low/Medium/High compliance level coverage
   - Export CSV template for human scoring
   - Instructions for manual evaluation

## 8. Error Analysis (TO BE IMPLEMENTED AFTER FULL RUN)
   [Placeholder cells — will be implemented after I run the full evaluation]
   - Per-ESRS-standard compliance accuracy table
   - Per-ESRS-standard judge-score breakdown
   - Retrieval-generation gap analysis
