## What NOT to Do

- Do NOT regenerate answers via OpenAI. Reuse the cached RQ2 `with_esrs_context` responses.
- Do NOT implement a claim-level factuality pipeline (like FActScore). The judge dimensions capture this at a sufficient granularity.
- Do NOT use RAGAS, DeepEval, or any external evaluation framework. Implement the metrics directly.
- Do NOT implement paired statistical tests. RQ3 is a single-condition study — only bootstrap CIs.
- Do NOT implement the error analysis cells (Section 8) in the first pass. These will be implemented after I run the full evaluation.
- Do NOT create separate notebooks for walkthrough vs evaluation. RQ3 is one notebook.
- Do NOT use 5 separate judge calls per sample. Use 1 call that scores all 5 dimensions.

